@* Three photographs fanned out (FX162, the design page's "Three businesses, three agents"): the one in the middle
   stands forward, the two beside it turn in, each with its caption and a reflection under it. A site gives them as
   records (ADR 0125). *@
<div class="shot-fan">
    @for (var index = 0; index < Items.Count; index++)
    {
        var shot = Items[index];
        <a class="@PlaceOf(index)" href="@shot.Href" data-reflect="@Reflect">
            <img src="@shot.Image" alt="" loading="lazy" />
            <span><b>@shot.Title</b>@shot.Line</span>
        </a>
    }
</div>
